  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox geography vcard vevent\" style=\"width:265px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"fn org summary\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height:1.2em; font-size:135%; font-weight:bold;\">Republic of the Rhineland\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; border-top:solid 1px #aaa; padding:0.2em 0em 0.2em 0em;\">\n<table style=\"width:100%; text-align:center; margin:0 auto; background:transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; font-size:30%; line-height:105%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Germany\" title=\"Germany\"><span style=\"font-size:300%;\">←</span></a> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Flag of Germany\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e6/Flag_of_Germany.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150815025838\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Germany.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Germany.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span><br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; font-size:115%; border:0;\"><b>2112–2139</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; text-align:right; line-height:105%; font-size:30%;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"European Association\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/12/European_Association.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20170817172319\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"European Association.png\" data-image-key=\"European_Association.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/European_Association\" title=\"European Association\"><span style=\"font-size:300%;\">→</span></a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"maptable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/3/31/Rhineland.png/revision/latest?cb=20171001211038\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Flag of Rhineland\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/3/31/Rhineland.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/125?cb=20171001211038\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Rhineland.png\" data-image-key=\"Rhineland.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span><br /> Flag\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:95%; padding:0.6em 0em 0.6em 0em;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/c/c7/Rhineland_Map.png/revision/latest?cb=20171001233428\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Location of Rhineland\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"296\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Rhineland Map.png\" data-image-key=\"Rhineland_Map.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/c/c7/Rhineland_Map.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20171001233428\" /></a><figcaption>Location of Rhineland</figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\">Frankfurt\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Government</b>\n</td>\n<td>Unitary parliamentary republic\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Legislature</b>\n</td>\n<td>Popular Assembly\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0;text-align:left;\">Upper house\n</td>\n<td>Senate\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0;text-align:left;\">Lower house\n</td>\n<td>Assembly\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>History</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Established\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2112\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Dissolution\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">September 16, 2139\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Today part of</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/European_Association\" title=\"European Association\">European Association</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Rhineland,&#160;</b> officially the <b>&#160;Republic of Rhineland</b>, was a sovereign nation&#160;located in Central Europe that would end up participating in the&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Third_Mexican-American_War\" title=\"Third Mexican-American War\">Third Mexican-American War</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRhineland%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Created after the dissolution of <a href=\"/wiki/Germany\" title=\"Germany\">Germany</a>, Rhineland bordered <a href=\"/wiki/Hanover\" title=\"Hanover\">Hanover</a> to the north, <a href=\"/wiki/Saxony\" title=\"Saxony\">Saxony</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Bavaria\" title=\"Bavaria\">Bavaria</a> to the east, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Switzerland (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3dpdHplcmxhbmQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Switzerland</span> to the south, and France and the Netherlands to the west. The main ethnic group of Rhineland were German's, with small populated pockets of French and Swiss. The main religion is Protestantism and Christianity, with a plurality of Islamic and generally non-religious citizens. The official language of Rhineland is German.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261115022753\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.107 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 879/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8763/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1368/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/100\nExpensive parser function count: 15/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639897/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   74.971      1 Template:Infobox_former_country\n100.00%   74.971      1 -total\n 65.76%   49.304      2 Template:Ns0\n 61.57%   46.159      1 Template:Infobox_former_country/autocat\n 37.82%   28.355      2 Template:Str_find\n  3.99%    2.991      2 Template